#. フン…それがどうした。
#. 俺の言ってる事に何か間違いがあるか？
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hmph. What, you think there's some mistake lurking in\n"
"what I said?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. フン…それがどうした。
#. 俺の言ってる事に何か間違いがあるか？
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hmph. What, you think there's some mistake lurking in\n"
"what I said?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ちょっと苗木、脅かさないでよ！
#. 何か変な事言ったかと思っちゃったじゃん！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"C'mon Makoto, don't scare me like that! Makes me think\n"
"something weird is going on!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>待てよ…事件が起きたのは植物庭園だったよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The incident took place in the garden, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、あの場所って…
#. 毎日決まった時間に何かがあるはずだったよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I remember, there's something that happens there\n"
"every morning at a certain time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>現場の植物庭園って、
#. 毎日決まった時間に何かがあるはずだったよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's something that happens in the garden at the\n"
"same time every morning...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、あの死体は濡れていない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Thinking back, the corpse was almost totally dry...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、死体はいつから、
#. あの場所にあった事になるんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In which case, I should be able to figure out when the\n"
"body must have appeared in the garden...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
